{"aspect":"16:9","quality":"1080p","canvas":"#F4F0E6","ink":"#111111","accent":"#E63B2E","muted":"#D8D2C4","brandBg":"#F4F0E6","primary":"explainer-video","skills":["explainer-video","diagram-animation","kinetic-typography","caption-animation","remotion-video","shot-composition","animation-principles","video-delivery-specs"],"coreIdea":"所谓的‘睡眠实验’是2010年恐怖网站编造的故事，没有任何证据；真正被证实的只有睡眠剥夺会带来幻觉。","contentLang":"zh","autoSfx":true,"scenes":[{"job":"hook","durationSec":5.04,"vo":"想象一下。五个人。一间完全密封的密室。","headline":"想象一下","visualIntent":"黑场起幅，冷白主标题以 ≥72 字号从景深外砸入满幅画面，弹簧回弹；五个囚犯剪影在密封门后停留；四周留 6% 安全区，胶片颗粒翻涌。","keyMotion":"标题砸入","skill":"kinetic-typography","narrationFile":"vo-0.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"snap","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/kenney-switch-1.wav","volume":0.156,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/kenney-switch-1.wav","sfxVolume":0.156,"sfxRole":"snap"},{"job":"setup","durationSec":2.976,"vo":"他们整整十五天，不许睡觉。","headline":"十五天不许睡","visualIntent":"时间码从 00:00 冲向 DAY 15；铁门锁链逐格合拢；睡眠图标被红叉划掉；低饱和冷灰底。","keyMotion":"锁链合拢","skill":"kinetic-typography","narrationFile":"vo-1.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"snap","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-switch-001.ogg","volume":0.147,"atSec":0.04}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-switch-001.ogg","sfxVolume":0.147,"sfxRole":"snap"},{"job":"legend","durationSec":5.808,"vo":"这就是“俄罗斯睡眠实验”，网上最让人毛骨悚然的都市传说之一。","headline":"俄罗斯睡眠实验","visualIntent":"标题碎切为西里尔字母与噪点，重新拼成“俄罗斯睡眠实验”；角落盖下“都市传说”印章；画面轻震。","keyMotion":"标题碎切","skill":"kinetic-typography","narrationFile":"vo-2.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"snap","intent":"enter","file":"sfx/iface-toggle-003.ogg","volume":0.147,"atSec":0.04},{"role":"confirm","intent":"settle","file":"sfx/ding.wav","volume":0.13,"atSec":5.488}],"sfxFile":"sfx/iface-toggle-003.ogg","sfxVolume":0.147,"sfxRole":"snap"},{"job":"context","durationSec":6.456,"vo":"据说，上世纪四十年代，苏联研究人员把五名政治犯关进了一间气密室。","headline":"四十年代实验","visualIntent":"伪档案界面推入；苏联地图冷化；五张政治犯编号卡滑入气密室平面图；密封门高亮。","keyMotion":"档案推入","skill":"diagram-animation","narrationFile":"vo-3.mp3","sfxCues":[{"role":"whoosh